{"ID":"20240118151020-gotcyna","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151020-gotcyna","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151020-gotcyna\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122151950-n1mk7p9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122152003-pxz1pia\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:227,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122152003-pxz1pia\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:27,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:27\u0026#125;","title":"276藜芦277钩吻","type":"doc","updated":"20240204090117"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240122151950-n1mk7p9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151950-n1mk7p9","updated":"20240122151951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"藜芦"}]},{"ID":"20240118151020-ddf9gvq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151020-ddf9gvq","updated":"20240122151915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名葱苒。味辛，寒，有毒。治蛊毒，咳逆，泄利，肠澼，头疡，疥瘙，恶疮，杀诸虫毒，去死肌。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151917-p79dvpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151917-p79dvpb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国陕西一带，各省亦多有之，生山谷中，根似葱有须而多毛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151919-ku42z3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151919-ku42z3r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛苦，性寒，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151921-f5gbp2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151921-f5gbp2x"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】藜芦为催吐要药，主风痰上塞，用吐一切恶物，通顶发嚏（嗅之），治风痫，外用治疮疥杀虫。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151923-3ib2tk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151923-3ib2tk9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗哕逆喉痹不通，鼻中息肉，马刀乱疮，不入汤用。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151925-x80g1p7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151925-x80g1p7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】主上气，去积年脓血泄利。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151927-wsmuwfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151927-wsmuwfo"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】除湿泄热解毒杀虫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151928-ex187a1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151928-ex187a1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一至二分。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151929-er82he6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151929-er82he6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】多服引吐，损人元气，畏葱白，服之吐即止，有辛烈气味，入鼻发嚏不止，饮冷水即止，能杀蝇，亦称蝇毒，黄莲为使，反细辛芍药，人参沙参，苦参，丹参，恶大黄。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151915-ph6imu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151915-ph6imu1"}},{"ID":"20240122151931-9z483uk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151931-9z483uk","updated":"20240204085941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二百七十六，就是藜芦，过去这个藜芦呢是使用在催吐剂。这藜芦长得很像葱，现在药房也不好买到，催吐剂。这是这个。"}]},{"ID":"20240122151931-xhcndvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151931-xhcndvg","updated":"20240204090052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】诸位看哦，它是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"催吐的主要的药，用吐一切恶物，所有的食物坏死的东西，吃到不干净的东西，统统可以吐掉。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通顶，你闻这个藜芦，一闻的时候啊，就会发，打喷嚏，就好像什么，吃到那个芥末一样。藜芦长得样子很像葱，一般我们现在药房没有，过去呢贫苦人家，河边采很多藜芦，长得很像葱啊，没有东西吃，就拿藜芦来吃，当葱当菜吃。这是一个恶心会催吐的。那这个很多食物中毒，过去的临床的案例上都可以治好它。吐剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240122151944-y2l37pu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151944-y2l37pu","updated":"20240122151945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【甄权】说去积年脓血泄利，除湿泄热解毒杀虫，很多肚子里面的蛔虫啊，以前我们药很多是杀虫的，因为中国古代虫很多啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240122151952-aqwsdml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151952-aqwsdml"}},{"ID":"20240122151953-0mv5kmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151953-0mv5kmu"}},{"ID":"20240122151953-8yunrr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151953-8yunrr0","updated":"20240122151958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"钩吻"}]},{"ID":"20240122151958-r2i74d0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151958-r2i74d0","updated":"20240122152003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名野葛。味辛，温，有大毒。治金疮，乳痉，中恶风，咳逆上气，水肿，杀鬼疰，蛊毒。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152003-pxz1pia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152003-pxz1pia","updated":"20240204090117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二百七十七，这是“钩吻”，现代人呢一般都看不出来什么药了。当然以后我们追，可以把它追出来是什么东西。"}]}]}